What the C actually does, and what I preserved:[0m[0m
[0m[0m
- The sRGB linearization mixes precisions. [38;5;10mR > 0.04045[0m, [38;5;10mpow((R + 0.055) / 1.055, 2.4)[0m and [38;5;10mR / 12.92[0m all promote the [38;5;10mfloat[0m channel to [38;5;10mdouble[0m because the literals are doubles; only the final assignment narrows back to [38;5;10mfloat[0m. Doing this naively in [38;5;10mf32[0m throughout would drift in the low mantissa bits, so [38;5;10mlinearize[0m casts to [38;5;10mf64[0m and back.[0m[0m
- The luminance sum is genuinely single-precision ([38;5;10m0.2126f * R + ...[0m), left to right, so that stays in [38;5;10mf32[0m.[0m[0m
- I call libm's [38;5;10mpow[0m through an [38;5;10mextern "C"[0m declaration instead of [38;5;10mf64::powf[0m, which removes any question of the two resolving to different implementations.[0m[0m
- The ratio is a bare [38;5;10mHigh / Low[0m. There's no [38;5;10m+ 0.05[0m offset (the WCAG formula has one) and no zero-denominator guard, so white-on-black returns [38;5;10m+inf[0m and black-on-black returns [38;5;10mNaN[0m. Per your instructions I reproduced this rather than fixing it; the verification run confirms those exact bit patterns ([38;5;10m0x7f800000[0m, [38;5;10m0xffc00000[0m). The [38;5;10mif (High < Low)[0m swap also stays a plain [38;5;10m<[0m, preserving C's behavior when a comparison against [38;5;10mNaN[0m is false.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
The header has no namespace macros, so the linker symbol is plain [38;5;10mcontrast_ratio[0m. [38;5;10mcb_rgb_255[0m is [38;5;10m#[repr(C)][0m with three [38;5;10mu8[0ms and is passed by value, matching the SysV ABI's packing of the 3-byte struct into a register.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
One note: I set [38;5;10mpanic = "abort"[0m in the release profile, since unwinding out of an [38;5;10mextern "C"[0m function would be undefined behavior. Nothing here can panic, so it's belt-and-braces.[0m[0m
